#: model:product.template,description_sale:art_craft.product_template_23
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Acrylic Kit:\n"
"            1) Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm paper pack of 20 A5\n"
"            2) Heavy Cartridge Mix Media 300 gsm paper pack of 20 A4\n"
"            3) Stationerie Artists’ Canvas Board 8”x10”\n"
"            4) Stationerie Artists’ Canvas Board 10”x12”\n"
"            5) Stationerie Homemade Gloss Varnish 90ml\n"
"            6) Stationerie Medium Wooden Palette (14.5×7.5)\n"
"            7) Stationerie Professional Handmade Flat Set Of 8 Hog White\n"
"            (0 1 2 4 6 8 10 12)\n"
"            8) Stationerie 2” Hog White Wash Inch Brush\n"
"            9) Stationerie Palette Knife (Sizes May Differ)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Kit acrílico:\n"
"1) Pacote de papel cartucho pesado Mix Media 300 g/m 20 A5\n"
"2) Pacote de papel cartucho pesado Mix Media 300 g/m 20 A4\n"
"3) Tela Stationerie Artists' 8 \"x10\"\n"
"4) Tela Stationerie Artists' 10 \"x12\"\n"
"5) Verniz brilhante caseiro Stationerie 90ml\n"
"6) Paleta média de madeira Stationerie (14.5×7,5)\n"
"7) Conjunto profissional Stationerie com 8 pinceis de pelo de porco brancos "
"feitos à mão (0 1 2 4 6 8 10 12)\n"
"8) Pincel de 2\" de pelo de porco Stationerie\n"
"9) Faca de paleta Stationerie (os tamanhos podem variar)\n"
"        "

